/-- **THE SYSTEM HAS ITS SOLUTION FOR EVERY REAL PARAMETER VECTOR IN THE INNER BOX** — in the bounding cube, unique
in the cube of its leaf. -/
theorem solution (p : ZBanach.Vec) (hin : InnerIn 80 p PS0) : Sol 3 Fs ys0 r0 PS0 p :=
  kt_root 3 Fs ys0 r0 40 0 60 80 T PS0 (by decide +kernel) p hin

